sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kafka as Kafka orders topic
    participant Worker as Inventory consumer example
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Kafka-->>Worker: Deliver OrderCreated at offset N
    Worker->>DB: Begin transaction, insert marker, apply stock and order changes, enqueue outcome
    DB-->>Worker: Commit transaction
    Note over Worker: Crash before offset commit.
    Note over Kafka,DB: Consumer restarts, or another consumer-group member takes over.
    Kafka-->>Worker: Redeliver OrderCreated at offset N
    Worker->>DB: Begin transaction, insert same consumer and event marker
    DB-->>Worker: Unique marker already exists
    Worker->>DB: Commit no-op transaction
    Worker->>Worker: Return Duplicate without repeating business effects
    Worker->>Kafka: Commit processed record N's offset

    Note over Worker,DB: DB retry window: 5 minutes, then exit without offset commit.
    Note over Kafka,Worker: Skip invalid records and commit offset.
